Package: genr
Title: R Bindings for the Gen Sequence Graph Database
Version: 0.1.31
Authors@R:
    person("GenHub", "Bio", email = "opensource@genhub.bio", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: R bindings for the Gen graph database and sequence version control
    system. The package embeds the Rust Gen engine via extendr and exposes
    repository initialization and database-context helpers to R. It targets
    sequence-centric genomics workflows and provides a small R interface over
    the Gen sequence graph engine.
License: Apache License 2.0 + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/genhub-bio/gen
BugReports: https://github.com/genhub-bio/gen/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
SystemRequirements: Prebuilt release binaries require no external toolchain;
    source builds require Cargo (Rust toolchain), libclang, and Cap'n Proto
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
NeedsCompilation: yes
